{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a1eadadad2b9514d6724a297577998027704d1ef1ed12583ed691d3ab832285a", "ja": "（今日の外回りは終了だ。あとはメールを確認して、\n書類も作らないと……ん？　あれは……）", "zh": "（今天的外勤工作结束了。接下来还得确认邮件、制作文件……嗯？那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "daae5c2748dea06bc3dea390f81bc4559abded2d4e82219d10c7ba42354aed3c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b6016942b0682de738c3591273b5c780e4221706fb370409b3808d6a9e5dac3f", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。どうしたんだ？\n今日は休みだったと思うけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。怎么了？\n我记得你今天休息来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "afd70ef982643cb6704b6d455ffbc7d8a8fb04d9ae7239a9340f7414b5608f23", "ja": "はい。その予定だったんですけど……。\nちょっと忘れ物をしちゃったみたいで。", "zh": "是的，本来是这么安排的……\n但我好像忘了带点东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4ddd469835008274fecb1a50108231da1d7bf8d70fcb48ff8781ed072fb2d66c", "ja": "なるほど。それで、劇場に取りに来たのか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，你是回来剧场取东西的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8435ea62f82fa254f033e814b3db6a78a4c030fc701bd799c3f22b9fba88e830", "ja": "ええ。着替えの時に落としちゃってたみたいで。\n{$P$}さんは、外回りの帰りですか？", "zh": "嗯。好像是在换衣服的时候不小心掉了。\n{$P$}先生是外出办事回来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "10a0afd792cd6af50df33386f11c252ea3cfa3f8667d595b5d49d7c98a6987dc", "ja": "ああ。これでやっと事務作業に取りかかれるよ……。", "zh": "啊，这下终于能开始处理办公室工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aa0b2dbc443bbb898a29852ecd48f8d3555ed2345e0a86eba25ae05037ab5a2b", "ja": "そうなんですね。お疲れさまです。\n……じゃあ、今日も遅くまでお仕事なんですね？", "zh": "原来如此。辛苦了。\n……那么，今天也要工作到很晚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cde38f1ee0992cad619d30148bf13656bc5962869e7160a228192984687807f2", "ja": "うっ……そう、だな。\nなるべく、早く帰れるようにはするけど。", "zh": "呃……是、这样啊。\n不过，我会尽量早点回去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c6ab5d49a83e2bd5d8d692dc0cd47094444e01bed251828250886ecac9197939", "ja": "そ、そうなんですね……。\nあ……ううっ、でも……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……。\n啊……呜，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fc92b4edf56390b069bcfdf47fc53d79f89f64184a8b474358605b378bbfe662", "ja": "風花？　どうした？", "zh": "风花？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "276d1920d6baf511c2722552c357fdbe545e6438abc99d9682a27f75ff46ada4", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん！\n私にもお仕事、手伝わせてください！", "zh": "啊，那个，{$P$}先生！\n也请让我帮忙工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a11ab0b8560e983bd90165040f75375bbdf096fa89bcbf518676382f65d67ad7", "ja": "そして、お仕事が終わったら……\n一緒にご飯に行きませんか？", "zh": "工作结束后……要不要一起去吃饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1014_p", "source_sha256": "16e4b98124adc913a8bcb3c50c18badd43b97d71db1e44c59e03558ee6631da7", "ja": "あっ、うん。俺は構わないけど……いいのか？\n出かける予定とかあったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "啊，嗯。我倒是没关系……真的可以吗？\n你不是原本有出门的安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2c081b10928cc917bf24e1306fa35c22da1c7de836d7b0e8063bdaef3aaf3074", "ja": "えっ？　この後は特にありませんけど……。\nあっ。もしかして、迷惑でしたか？", "zh": "诶？之后没什么特别的安排……  \n啊，难道是给你添麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4f3beb04a3cc7852631840bcdadb28d9dd14c8bee1a9e69d373907d3b401266f", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。\nただオシャレしてるから、どこかに行くのかと……。", "zh": "没有，怎么会呢。\n只是看你打扮得这么漂亮，还以为你要去哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aae491f536936f3dafe11918c62792b303fe8d77d4308a8a5cece06bbf2653de", "ja": "ふふっ、これは自分の気持ちを高めるためのおしゃれ\nなんです。だから、お出かけの予定とかはなくて。", "zh": "呵呵，这是为了让自己心情更好的打扮。所以，并没有要出门的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c6fa931335e43d968f1f655a964d5d813a53ddd9fdbc8a92f35a442e2155c3df", "ja": "でも、このまま家に帰るのも、\nもったいないって思ってたところだったんです。", "zh": "不过，我正觉得就这样回家也太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1019_p", "source_sha256": "487dba1c8498bfe83860770499cf133d45bf540d55285e10fc65c2509a4ed29f", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。それなら……\n仕事を手伝ってくれるお礼に、食事は奢るよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事。既然这样……\n作为你帮忙工作的答谢，我请你吃饭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "266836e42e119a1abd0dc1eabbd96add2c1593c23982c8f788967527848bcd89", "ja": "えっ！　そこまでしなくても、大丈夫ですよ？\n手伝いも私から言ったことですし……。", "zh": "诶！不用做到这种程度，真的没关系的啦？\n帮忙也是我自己主动提出来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1021_p", "source_sha256": "013a1e28ae0d7f7aa34f9e467ae3b755cc431f88589abb1687e2afe847459752", "ja": "いいから、いいから。\nお礼くらいさせてくれ。", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n至少让我表示一下谢意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e7539f1fb6f91501331174a876162acb26714414aeb7add2bf2a9ba7ef720b17", "ja": "わかりました。ありがとうございます♪　それじゃ、\nおすすめのお店があるんですけど、そこでいいですか？", "zh": "我知道了。谢谢你♪ 那么，\n我有一家推荐的店，可以去那里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2e9b32442f9856bdc933e59924a5e4f346fb306ce7cd75446fbe886047e2610f", "ja": "もちろん。\n風花のおすすめか……どんなお店だろう？", "zh": "当然可以。\n是风花推荐的店啊……会是什么样的店呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d49dc98f2d202fdc0f5c389bf4ead8cee8ab4ad0490440a3826705d8723ff7e3", "ja": "それは、行ってからのお楽しみです。\n気に入ってもらえるといいんですけど……。", "zh": "那就等去了之后再揭晓吧。\n希望你会喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0402f6bc816aecaa52a8627060c3926835cf6d732088ec99a308f32a6c3f52b1", "ja": "よし、楽しみも待ってることだし。\n急いで仕事を終わらせなきゃな！", "zh": "好，既然还有期待的事情在等着我们。\n得赶紧把工作做完才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0404_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d3631cbff3a63d9a680eff25daa62cfea1006014173ab0774e48bb4bee9651dd", "ja": "はい！　……思いきって、お気に入りの服を着てきて\nよかった。今日は素敵な一日になりそう。ふふっ♪", "zh": "是！……鼓起勇气穿着自己喜欢的衣服过来，真是太好了。今天似乎会是美好的一天。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
